[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5942.07, "timestamp": "01:39:02", "text": "陪著薩喬。所以，每當他喝完他的飲料，我也喝完我的飲料時，他就會問你還要嗎，然後我們就再去拿。我當時就想，好吧。然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5944.95, "timestamp": "01:39:04", "text": "我也會拿跟他一樣的金額"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5947.35, "timestamp": "01:39:07", "text": "。我當時大概喝完了五瓶啤酒。  我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5955.59, "timestamp": "01:39:15", "text": "然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5958.47, "timestamp": "01:39:18", "text": "我就想去喝葡萄酒，但問題是總得有人陪著，而當時只有我一個人在喝酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5962.55, "timestamp": "01:39:22", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5964.07, "timestamp": "01:39:24", "text": "所以他就像是說"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5973.75, "timestamp": "01:39:33", "text": "葡萄酒一樣，然後我就說，然後他就開始倒酒了。我當時就想，好吧，我就讓他倒這麼多，然後"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5980.4, "timestamp": "01:39:40", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "driving license where "}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5980.936, "timestamp": "01:39:40", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "saiko he's uncle dayoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5986.27, "timestamp": "01:39:46", "text": "我慢慢地喝，這樣我就可以陪他喝。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5992.87, "timestamp": "01:39:52", "text": "不喜歡自己不是唯一一個喝酒的人。我得陪著，我當時只喝了那種垃圾"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5997.508, "timestamp": "01:39:57", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't get fooled by this man"}]